WEBVTT

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:08.720
I'll eat.

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:10.690
I'll eat it. I...

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:16.600
I'll eat.

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:20.200
Rito-chan!

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:24.630
Rito-chan, your drawings are the best!

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:26.170
Rito-chan, your drawings are so cute!

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:27.610
Rito-chan!

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:28.670
Rito-chan!

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:30.990
How strange.

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:33.200
Everyone's complimenting me.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.870
Because you ate the candy.

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:37.660
If you eat more, you'll get 
even more compliments.

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:39.740
Yeah. I'll eat more.

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:41.020
I'll keep eating.

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:12.590
I'll eat...

00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:17.020
She's eating so fast.

00:02:17.020 --> 00:02:20.140
I've never seen Rito-chan eat so much before.

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:25.120
I'm sort of worried, indeed.

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:27.330
Oh, but this is for the best, yes.

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:32.760
Oh, yeah. I should eat more, too.

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:35.560
I don't have time to stand around 
being glad that Rito gets it now.

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:36.920
I need to get my followers back.

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:43.260
Here, Rito-chan.

00:02:43.590 --> 00:02:45.470
There's plenty more.

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:48.140
I have to eat.

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:49.890
I have to eat more.

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:52.860
More. Lots more.

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:54.360
I have to eat.

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:55.970
I have to eat.

00:02:55.970 --> 00:02:57.830
More. More...

00:02:58.340 --> 00:03:01.580
Now we can all be together forever.

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:03.990
I need to eat more, too.

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:14.250
She seems to be in pain, indeed.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:21.970
I can't believe she's changing so quickly.

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:26.840
I'll... eat.

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:30.090
I'll eat so everyone will 
look at my drawings.

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:34.010
I'm sick of having no one 
looking at my drawings.

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:39.000
More. Look at me more.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:43.080
Mari-chan, Rito-chan, 
we'll be together forever.

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:52.080
Mari-chan, something's wrong with Rito-chan!

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:53.260
Mari-chan!

00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:54.900
What? Stop bothering me.

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:56.590
Look! Rito-chan is...

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:09.100
Wh-What is that?

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:13.190
That's really Rito-chan, right?

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:16.020
She's changed, indeed.

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:18.680
Mari-chan...

00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:19.950
She's changed too much!

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:21.990
No one said we'd end up looking like that!

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:26.960
Even if I become a Scooper, I won't change.

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:31.780
Because... I just want to create.

00:04:31.780 --> 00:04:33.650
Rito-chan, what's wrong?

00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:35.700
A-Are you celebrating Halloween early?

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:39.380
Rito, you disguised yourself 
so you could scare us, right?

00:04:47.060 --> 00:04:48.200
Mari-chan!

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:53.350
Why can't I just draw what I want to draw?

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:01.400
Let me draw what I want!

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.530
No way...

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:07.450
She destroyed a building in a single blow!

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:12.920
What an incredible amount of energy!

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:14.880
What is this?

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:19.710
I just want someone to look at 
the drawings I make for fun!

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:23.040
What's going on?

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:25.380
Is Rito-chan's power out of control?

00:05:26.080 --> 00:05:28.390
I want them to see what I draw.

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:33.350
I want them to say they like 
the things I draw for fun!

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:34.060
No!

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:35.810
Rito-chan, stop!

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:48.420
Why are you looking at me like that?

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:50.000
What are you afraid of?

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:53.810
You want to quit because 
all you can do is copy?

00:05:53.810 --> 00:05:56.520
You can't make anything because 
all you have is knowledge?

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:58.210
Why would you say such things?

00:05:58.210 --> 00:05:58.750
Rito...

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:02.520
I've just liked drawing since I was little.

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:08.470
I had no idea what I wanted to 
be or could be when I grew up.

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:11.020
I didn't really have any dreams.

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:14.160
But I loved drawing.

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:17.600
I looked at lots of drawings, 
copied drawings I liked,

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:21.530
and practiced a lot so I could 
find out what I wanted to draw.

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:24.410
I believe there's such a thing as

00:06:24.410 --> 00:06:28.350
creativity born from copying others 
and researching various information.

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:29.410
Rito-chan...

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:33.910
But is the reason I can think that way 
because I can draw by myself?

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:35.460
Well...

00:06:35.460 --> 00:06:37.620
That's what you said, Mari.

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:39.370
I did, but...

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:40.330
But you're wrong!

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:45.170
I felt uncertain drawing alone. I was lonely.

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:46.750
Do you understand

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:49.510
how it feels to draw and draw, 
but have nobody see it?

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:54.150
My dad, my mom, my classmates, my teachers...

00:06:54.150 --> 00:06:55.840
No one would look at them.

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:58.200
I don't want that anymore!

00:06:58.200 --> 00:06:59.080
Rito...

00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:02.660
We had no idea you felt that way.

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:04.440
But...

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:07.440
You two said they were cute.

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:09.190
Were you lying?

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:11.040
What? No!

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:11.950
That wasn't a lie!

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:14.590
Yeah! It wasn't a lie, Rito-chan!

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:18.530
I want to draw!

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:20.500
I want to draw so much!

00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:22.790
What do you think of this?

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:25.840
And this?

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:29.440
Rito...

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:30.950
Rito-chan, stop!

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:37.280
I'll make lots of drawings.

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:39.590
Tell me they're cute, 
just like you always do.

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:41.560
Rito, where are you going?

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:44.800
I'm worried, indeed.

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:48.010
For some reason, her energy 
level is out of control.

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:49.870
But it's not a problem.

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:52.760
If it breaks, they can make a new one.

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:54.620
They're capable of that.

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:06.400
More! I want to draw more!

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:15.450
That's not Rito-chan.

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:17.140
Yeah...

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:20.110
Where is Rito going?

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:25.020
Rito-chan's charging straight ahead and 
destroying everything in her path.

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:29.600
But if she crosses Cat Street...

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:45.700
Miss Rito seems to be in pain, indeed.

00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:49.630
It's just because she's changing too quickly.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:52.260
She should calm down eventually, yes.

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:54.220
Will she really?

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:59.630
Either way, all we can do 
is watch her transform.

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:02.020
Miss Rito...

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:08.740
Rito, wait! Listen to us!

00:09:08.740 --> 00:09:11.370
Rito-chan, wait! Please!

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:16.280
I'll draw.

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:19.950
I'll keep drawing new things!

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:24.370
You'll destroy your drawing!

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:26.830
Rito-chan, you can't destroy that!

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:29.330
I'll draw and draw and draw!

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:30.280
It's no use.

00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:32.460
Our voices aren't reaching her.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:34.800
Then we'll have to stop her by force.

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:41.850
I don't want to do this.

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:44.560
But Rito, if you won't stop this...

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:46.050
Mari-chan!

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:48.060
If there's another way, tell me!

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:51.290
Sorry. You're right.

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:57.360
Rito, are we stuck this way now?

00:09:58.050 --> 00:10:00.040
Will it end like this?

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:02.780
Is this really how it's going to end?

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:09.210
Ugh!

00:10:09.550 --> 00:10:11.820
I can't do this!

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:13.170
Mari-chan...

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:18.010
Watch me draw!

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:21.090
Rito-chan, no!

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:31.460
Kotoko, Rito stopped moving.

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:32.560
Yeah.

00:10:33.030 --> 00:10:34.520
That's...

00:10:34.520 --> 00:10:37.040
Mari-chan, I have mine.

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:39.090
I always carry mine, too.

00:10:41.210 --> 00:10:44.530
Rito, you remember these candies, don't you?

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:47.820
It all started the day you gave these to us.

00:10:49.810 --> 00:10:51.020
Rito-chan?

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:52.250
You can have them.

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:57.170
I have plenty.

00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:07.260
N-Nice to... meet you...

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:10.480
Was that supposed to be a fade-out?

00:11:13.740 --> 00:11:17.590
Fold wrinkled clothes that customers have 
touched whenever you get the chance.

00:11:17.590 --> 00:11:19.970
You can talk to customers,

00:11:19.970 --> 00:11:22.660
but if they don't want to talk, 
just leave them alone.

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:23.610
Oh...

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:26.480
Oh, yes. Today's sweet is wasabi chocolat.

00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:28.640
Let customers know if they ask.

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:31.670
And, uh...

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:33.830
Um, ah...

00:11:34.470 --> 00:11:36.830
Shirako Mari. You can call me Mari.

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:38.270
Ask away.

00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:41.970
Mari... chan, how long have 
you been working here?

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:44.580
Me? I started today.

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:45.260
Huh?

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:48.440
I guess I'm your senior by about 30 minutes.

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:50.310
But you already know what to do?

00:11:50.590 --> 00:11:52.900
I love shops and visit them all the time.

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:55.370
I know more or less what to do.

00:11:55.370 --> 00:11:56.480
I see.

00:11:56.740 --> 00:12:00.250
There's another girl who started today, too.

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:02.200
Is it her?

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.900
This has the Japanese touch 
that's popular right now.

00:12:04.900 --> 00:12:07.410
Chocolate sprinkled with wasabi powder, huh?

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:09.670
There's wasabi paste inside, too.

00:12:09.670 --> 00:12:13.480
The spiciness is followed by sweetness, 
followed by more spiciness.

00:12:13.480 --> 00:12:16.130
Just smelling it brings tears to my eyes!

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:19.100
Is she physically related to 
wasabi chocolat or something?

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:23.220
By the way, that's an unusual pendant.

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:24.510
It's a pen.

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:26.910
I don't feel right without it.

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:29.060
And there's no telling when 
I'll feel like drawing.

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:31.680
Draw what? Like illustrations?

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:33.780
Yeah, more or less.

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:35.920
Huh... Oh, I know.

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:38.300
The owner asked us to draw a sign.

00:12:38.300 --> 00:12:39.700
Can you do that?

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:41.060
Me?

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:41.690
Yeah.

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:43.530
B-But...

00:12:43.720 --> 00:12:45.880
Draw something in the 
open space on this sign.

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:46.910
It can be anything.

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:47.990
Whatever you like.

00:12:48.440 --> 00:12:50.680
Whatever I like?

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:56.660
H-How's this?

00:12:57.600 --> 00:12:59.720
I can redraw it if you don't like it.

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:00.980
I've never seen that before.

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:02.300
What character is it?

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:05.840
It's not one, really... 
It's just a cat I always draw.

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:07.810
So it's original? How cute!

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:10.880
I know. Can you draw a girl?

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:11.810
A girl?

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:13.390
A cute girl!

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:18.370
One wearing a trendy leather jacket 
and a fluffy flower print skirt.

00:13:18.370 --> 00:13:20.140
Okay. I can do that.

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:25.360
It's so cute!

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:27.190
Cute?

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:28.070
What's wrong?

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:31.610
Nothing... I'm just surprised.

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:33.080
Why?

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:36.160
No one's ever called my drawings cute before.

00:13:37.140 --> 00:13:38.500
You shouldn't lie.

00:13:38.870 --> 00:13:40.380
I'm not lying.

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:41.320
Really?

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:41.840
Yeah.

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:45.360
Since the cat and girl were so cute,

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:47.800
I thought you'd copied an existing character.

00:13:48.030 --> 00:13:50.890
I don't know much about popular 
characters these days.

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:52.870
Can I ask you to draw more?

00:13:52.870 --> 00:13:57.240
I love making clothes, but I'm 
not good at sketching designs.

00:13:57.240 --> 00:14:00.310
I've been looking for someone 
to draw them for me!

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:02.320
Uh, I...

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:03.540
How cute!

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:04.690
What? Did you warp here?

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:07.920
That's a girl you'd expect to find 
anywhere, but doesn't exist.

00:14:07.920 --> 00:14:10.000
She seems familiar, but 
I've never seen her before.

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:11.580
I've never seen anything like it!

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:14.010
Right? You've got a good eye.

00:14:14.010 --> 00:14:14.800
Wh-What?

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:17.560
I was just thinking about new sweets.

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:20.370
The other day, I saw an image 
online of red bean paste

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:22.560
and rice flour dumplings 
arranged to look like a panda.

00:14:22.560 --> 00:14:25.190
What do you think of adding soybean 
paste, cherry blossom paste,

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:27.860
and soda paste to create four-color pandas?

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:29.350
Wh-Why not?

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:32.100
That's far beyond anything 
I can imagine, though.

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:33.730
Also, um...

00:14:33.730 --> 00:14:37.970
Man, it'd be so much easier 
to explain it with a drawing!

00:14:38.380 --> 00:14:40.980
So... like this?

00:14:41.220 --> 00:14:44.800
Wow! It's even cuter than 
what I was imagining!

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:46.420
People will love these!

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:50.810
I can't believe you drew it so quickly 
after such a simple explanation.

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:52.320
Just who are you?

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:56.540
I'm Sudo Rito.

00:14:56.890 --> 00:14:58.180
Rito-chan!

00:14:58.180 --> 00:14:59.580
N-Nice to meet you.

00:14:59.820 --> 00:15:01.010
Here, Rito.

00:15:01.740 --> 00:15:03.260
Let's exchange IDs.

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:03.960
O-Okay.

00:15:04.490 --> 00:15:05.170
Thanks.

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:06.630
Uh...

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:09.690
Do you not have a smartphone?

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:10.960
I-I have one.

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:12.460
High-speed link.

00:15:12.460 --> 00:15:14.140
Then let's exchange IDs.

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:15.920
Are you sure?

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:16.840
Sure.

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:17.740
Really?

00:15:17.740 --> 00:15:18.350
Yeah.

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:19.730
Really, really?

00:15:20.010 --> 00:15:21.380
Is there a problem?

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:22.900
No, not at all!

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:23.900
No problem!

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:25.610
Then let's all exchange IDs.

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:26.270
Okay.

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:28.020
I-I'm setting it up now.

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:30.540
Security unlocked, certification level...

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:32.180
Friend, OK?

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:33.040
OK.

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:35.900
Calm down. We're not going anywhere.

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:36.820
I got it.

00:15:36.820 --> 00:15:38.500
Kotoko-chan?

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:40.310
Watatsumugi Kotoko.

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:41.280
I'm Mari.

00:15:41.280 --> 00:15:43.220
Nice to meet you, Kotoko.

00:15:43.220 --> 00:15:44.400
We did it!

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:46.330
Rito-chan and Mari-chan.

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:47.300
<b>NEW Friend</b>

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:47.300
<b>Rito-chan</b>

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:47.300
<b>Mari-chan</b>

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:47.300
Registration 
Complete

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:47.720
Registration complete.

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:49.410
What an interesting girl.

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:50.210
Yeah.

00:15:50.210 --> 00:15:51.630
Oh, right.

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:53.520
Have some.

00:15:53.520 --> 00:15:55.390
Wow, pop cats!

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:56.960
It's Rito-chan's drawing!

00:15:56.960 --> 00:15:58.660
Yeah, I made them.

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:00.310
You can have them. I have plenty.

00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:03.760
They're too cute to eat, 
but I'll have just one.

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:04.570
Now?

00:16:04.570 --> 00:16:06.300
Don't tell the owner.

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:07.410
Okay.

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:09.440
They're good!

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:10.820
Now we're partners in crime.

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:21.180
Rito, you remember, don't you?

00:16:21.180 --> 00:16:22.040
Try to remember!

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:25.000
The day we decided to open Park together!

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:29.860
This store is full of cute products.

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:33.090
Yeah. We're so lucky to be 
surrounded by all these cute things.

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:36.440
Why don't we create our own 
brand and sell merchandise?

00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:38.580
Huh? Our own brand?

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:41.000
What? Wow! Let's try it!

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.730
Can we do that?

00:16:43.090 --> 00:16:44.390
Sure we can.

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:47.110
We need to come up with a brand name first.

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:48.820
Park?

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:51.870
Yeah, a place where everyone can relax.

00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:54.050
That's great. It's the perfect name.

00:16:54.050 --> 00:16:55.320
It's really good!

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:56.830
What should our first product be?

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:58.340
Stickers with our logo?

00:16:58.340 --> 00:17:01.880
Maybe we should come up with a mascot, too.

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:05.080
How about that cat Rito always draws?

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:05.600
This?

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:06.700
Yeah, that.

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:08.250
It's cute.

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:14.470
But since this is yours, why don't 
we try changing it a little?

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:19.760
For example, you could give it a snood like 
the one this magazine model is wearing.

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:21.490
Snoods are nice!

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:24.480
How's this?

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:26.060
Nice!

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:28.400
What?!

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:30.380
A limited-time store?

00:17:30.380 --> 00:17:34.480
Yeah. We'll run a store of 
our own over spring break.

00:17:35.480 --> 00:17:36.490
Really?

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:38.800
Yeah. When I asked the owner about it,

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:41.120
they said, "Now I can go 
on vacation. Lucky me."

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:42.400
How carefree.

00:17:42.400 --> 00:17:43.760
That's what I like about them, though.

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:45.690
So can I accept the offer?

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:46.760
Yeah!

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:48.580
My answer's yes, of course.

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:49.900
It's decided, then.

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:51.540
Let's hold a meeting after work.

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:54.390
I need to tell my mom I'll be late.

00:17:54.390 --> 00:17:56.480
Our very own store, huh?

00:17:56.480 --> 00:17:58.610
I want to create a special parfait.

00:17:58.610 --> 00:18:01.000
We should change the interior, too.

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:04.400
Let's install a sewing machine 
and build a creative space.

00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:05.480
Great idea.

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:08.760
Does anyone know any wizards?

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:10.600
I can use programs.

00:18:12.810 --> 00:18:14.610
Do you remember now, Rito?

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:17.940
Our memories are like these candies.

00:18:17.940 --> 00:18:20.880
They're fun and cute no matter 
which part you're looking at.

00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:24.290
So let's keep having fun together.

00:18:25.260 --> 00:18:28.370
Fun, cute memories...

00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:47.820
I drew the things you requested, 
and you called them cute.

00:18:47.820 --> 00:18:49.730
That gave me more ideas.

00:18:50.680 --> 00:18:53.960
I really loved the time 
I spent creating that way.

00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:55.690
I was happy.

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:57.260
Rito-chan...

00:18:57.260 --> 00:19:00.300
I've always felt that way.

00:19:00.300 --> 00:19:02.660
The Scoopers came right after that.

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:06.520
Then the bubble appeared, 
and all this happened, but...

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:09.540
Rito...

00:19:10.480 --> 00:19:13.460
But I haven't changed.

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:18.170
I still want the three of 
us to run Park together.

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:20.050
That's never changed.

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:26.950
I love making things together at Park, too.

00:19:26.950 --> 00:19:28.360
Me, too.

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:33.040
Mari, Kotoko.

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:35.110
Sorry for making you worry.

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:36.510
Seriously.

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:40.520
But I was the first one to 
leave Park and make you worry.

00:19:40.520 --> 00:19:41.810
I'm sorry.

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:44.420
I made you worry, too.

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:45.070
I'm sorry.

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:50.830
All we do is worry.

00:19:50.830 --> 00:19:53.000
That's why we have to stick together.

00:19:53.480 --> 00:19:54.250
Yeah.

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:57.850
Jeez, my makeup is a mess now.

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:04.830
Sorry to interrupt, but why are 
you all just standing around?

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:07.720
You need to eat more, or you'll grow weaker.

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:09.660
You're right.

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:13.580
I'd forgotten there was 
someone who had to pay.

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:16.810
We won't eat any more.

00:20:16.810 --> 00:20:19.030
We won't do what you want.

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:21.360
You won't eat?

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:22.570
Are you sure?

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:24.860
You don't care if you lose your followers?

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:27.530
You don't mind being alone again?

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:30.950
You want to go back to looking 
at your drawings alone?

00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:33.000
Those days will never return.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:36.170
Mari and Kotoko will always 
look at my drawings.

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:39.080
Yeah. We'll be together forever.

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:41.630
We'll find more fans for Park together.

00:20:41.980 --> 00:20:45.590
We'll be creative on our own.

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:48.050
We don't need your power.

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:50.430
We don't need...

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:54.560
this!

00:20:57.260 --> 00:20:59.210
Wh-What are you doing?

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:00.790
I'm so surprised, I'll say it twice!

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:03.200
What are you doing?!

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:06.260
Then I'll make you say it twice more!

00:21:10.170 --> 00:21:11.330
Bye-bye.

00:21:14.810 --> 00:21:18.910
I'm so surprised, I can't even speak!

00:21:20.520 --> 00:21:23.620
We won't eat or fight anymore.

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:26.360
What is this?

00:21:29.340 --> 00:21:30.430
Look.

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:34.190
The marks...

00:21:34.190 --> 00:21:35.940
We're back to normal!

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:37.630
Why? Is this a miracle?

00:21:37.630 --> 00:21:39.920
The accumulated products 
of our imagination

00:21:39.920 --> 00:21:42.860
inside our bodies must have
disappeared with the Amatsumara.

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:45.570
Products of our imagination?

00:21:45.810 --> 00:21:49.660
The Amatsumara were a reflection 
of our thoughts, right?

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:54.250
So it must have entered our bodies and 
latched on to our neurotransmitters—

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:58.040
I'm not sure what that means, 
but why don't we call it a miracle?

00:21:59.480 --> 00:22:00.290
Yeah.

00:22:00.520 --> 00:22:01.960
Sounds good to me.

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:03.530
There's nothing good about it!

00:22:03.530 --> 00:22:07.110
I don't understand why you'd 
give up the power you acquired!

00:22:07.110 --> 00:22:09.010
I don't understand!

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:11.300
I'm so surprised, I said it twice!

00:22:11.300 --> 00:22:12.680
Don't worry.

00:22:12.680 --> 00:22:15.840
We don't expect you to understand.

00:22:15.840 --> 00:22:18.930
I doubt you can.

00:22:18.930 --> 00:22:21.150
Not since all you do is steal.

00:22:21.900 --> 00:22:24.800
Our creativity is in here.

00:22:24.800 --> 00:22:26.380
That's enough.

00:22:26.380 --> 00:22:28.360
We don't need false power.

00:22:28.850 --> 00:22:31.360
False power...

00:22:33.980 --> 00:22:36.330
Since it's come to this...

00:23:25.460 --> 00:23:29.170
Let's name as many cute 
Harajuku things as we can.

00:23:29.170 --> 00:23:30.770
Bring it on!

00:23:30.770 --> 00:23:32.130
I'll go first.

00:23:32.130 --> 00:23:34.410
Tokishita Street, crêpes, Cat Street...

00:23:34.410 --> 00:23:36.930
Uh, miss? When should I name mine?

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Illustrated by Kiato</b>
